PARTS OF THIS CAN BE DONE USING   this role : https://github.com/robertdebock/ansible-role-users

```yaml
---
# Configures the deploy user for rrsync-only access.
# The deploy user exists (created by robertdebock.users).
# This task sets up the forced command and sites root.

- name: Ensure sites root exists
 ansible.builtin.file:
